y, their bodies are struck down—even if such men attain the formless Brahman light, they still have to come down again to enjoy material pleasures due to lack of knowledge of devotion. As long as a human\nshows interest in action and knowledge, he continues to endure the sufferings of physical life—birth, death, old age, disease—\n. Employees are bound to have to take up one body part after another. As far as\nthe question of the wise is, until they reach the pinnacle of knowledge, they are repeatedly in this world"
